// WAS: the Sync extension view's registry entry, and the named wrapper its loadItems field needed
// ANCHOR: the wrapper was the last of the named wrappers, after calendarDetailLines; the ViewDef
//      sat between the "calendar" one and the "builtins" one, so removing it shifts every later
//      extension index down by one. Nothing refers to those by number (extViewIndex is by name).
